{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13392","headline":"晚秋石门礼拜 · 阎防","name":"晚秋石门礼拜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轻策临绝壁，招提谒金仙。\n舟车无由径，岩峤乃属天。\n踯躅淹昃景，夷犹望新弦。\n石门变暝色，谷口生人烟。\n阳鴈叫平楚，秋风急寒川。\n驰晖苦代谢，浮脆慙贞坚。\n永欲卧丘壑，息心依梵筵。\n誓将历劫愿，无以外物牵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}